  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil. <br>• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. <br>• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.</p> <p>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don&#39;t peek!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857f60d0527cba53b0758/step-bdf6f800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, using a vegetable peeler, peel cucumber (stopping when you reach the seeds in the centre) into ribbons. <br>• Cut apple into thin sticks. <br>• Cut lime into wedges.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857f60d0527cba53b0758/step-eeca2910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When rice has 5 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook plant-based mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 3-4 minutes. <br>• Add sweet soy seasoning and ginger lemongrass paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Remove from heat and stir in sweet chilli sauce, the soy sauce and a squeeze of lime juice, until veggie mince is coated.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857f60d0527cba53b0758/step-438b3320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, apple, deluxe salad mix and sesame dressing. Season to taste. <br>• Divide rice and deluxe sesame salad between bowls. Top with Thai chilli ginger and lemongrass veggie larb. <br>• Tear over mint. Serve with any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f857f60d0527cba53b0758/step-f1279a30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
